SUMMARY:Tandem Tuesday – English/German Language Café
LOCATION:Café Lindwurm, Hohenzollernstraße 41, 80801 München
DESCRIPTION:Practise German or English over coffee in Schwabing.
 Entry is free, just order a drink at the bar.
 Most people come alone, so don't be shy!
 All levels welcome, from A1 to native.
 First time? Look for the table with the little flags.
 Usually 15-25 people.
